<title>BELGIUM: Belgian company investment rose 15.6 pct in Oct.</title>
<headline>Belgian company investment rose 15.6 pct in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's National Statistics Institute (NSI) released the following data on corporate investment, calculated from VAT returns, for (mth) -</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     Oct 1996   pvs mth   Oct 1995</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1985)   204.9	200.2     177.3</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	   15.6	  0.1</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     Jan-Oct period    Jan-Sept period</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	    5.9		   4.8</p>
<p>NOTE - non-industrial investments rose by 2.6 percent in the first 10 months, industrial investments rose by 11.3 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
